      "selectedIndexes": [
        -1,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "遇到假酒的可能性还是很小的，但是品相不全有问题的情况还是有过几次的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "filename": "20260127_00004330_atpj_269_22.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004330_atpj_269_spk0/20260127_00004330_atpj_269_22.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        -1,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "如果酒没问题就不找他退换货了。"
    },
